    "title_en": "$p$-Harmonic gauge and the regularity of spacetime isometries",
    "abstract_en": "We show every Lorentzian metric of class $C^{k,α}$, where $k\\in\\mathbf{N}_0$ and $α\\in(0,1)$, admits local coordinates of class $C^{k+1,α}$ all of whose coordinate functions are temporal functions that are harmonic with respect to a nonlinear $p$-wave operator, where $p\\in(-\\infty,1)$. Unlike the classical wave operator, this operator is elliptic on temporal functions. As an application, we show that an isometry between Lorentzian metrics of class $C^{k,α}$ is of class $C^{k+1,α}$.",
